  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;be the line through the intersection of the planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then, the equation of the plane passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and perpendicular to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "A vector parallel to the line of intersection is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Also, the line of intersection is perpendicular to the required plane.<br />Hence, equation of the plane is <math><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>"
  }
